   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Bisogna versus si deve",
     "texto": [
      "**Bisogna** is always invariable and is followed by an infinitive: **Bisogna prenotare in anticipo** (you have to book in advance).",
      "With a singular noun depending on the modal: **Si deve mostrare il documento**; with a plural direct noun: **Si devono rispettare le regole** (the rules must be followed)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Safety rules and procedures",
     "texto": [
      "These structures are common at airports, museums, administrative offices and instruction manuals: **Per accedere si deve presentare la ricevuta**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
